-- --- Program ↔ career mapping ----------------------------------------------------------
--
-- **The rows §27 actually ranks programs on.** A program's RIASEC compatibility is the *average*
-- of its linked careers' Holland codes (`programRiasecCompatibility`); a program with no mapping
-- takes the neutral 50 and is therefore indistinguishable from every other unmapped program. An
-- unmapped catalog looks complete on the admin screens and produces a flat, meaningless ranking —
-- which is why every offering below is mapped, not just the obvious ones.

